ISO-10303-21;
/* Pmi086: Three GENERAL_PROPERTY entries carry free-form attributes ('revision', 'status', 'owner') on a configuration-placeholder part with no geometry; the writer routes attribute emission through the styled-item pipeline which is skipped for parts with empty shape representations; on round-trip all three GENERAL_PROPERTY entities are silently dropped; receivers must emit GENERAL_PROPERTY entries for every labelled part regardless of whether the label has geometry; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty */
